(Japanese: '''火老賀タマル'''  ''Tamaru Hirōga'') is a character from [[Pokémon Battrio: Aim to be Battrio Master!]].

==History==
Tamaru first appeared in [[ABM05]] where he challenged [[Ryū Tendō|Ryū]] to a Battrio match after defeating [[Yai Suba]]. The match wasn't fully shown except for the ending where Tamaru ended up beaten.

